    {"id": "dlg/38/1", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 38, "entry": 1, "source": "Hrmm... This damn smell. I can't believe that Krista still didn't do anything! I... I'm sorry about that. It has been so stressful lately. People die here. Everyday someone dies. Suicides, murders, accidents and so on. Sigh... Why are you here? Did someone die?", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Stein Bergland | Stein Bergland"},
    {"id": "dlg/38/2", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 38, "entry": 2, "source": "Do you have some problem?", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Stein Bergland | Player"},
    {"id": "dlg/38/9", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 38, "entry": 9, "source": "I will come later. (Leave)", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Stein Bergland | Player"},
    {"id": "dlg/55/1", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 55, "entry": 1, "source": "If you're as ill as you look,\\,\\, buy some \\,REAL\\, medicine,\\, not bogus mushroom and herbs mixtures...\\,\\,\\, If you can afford it, of course!\\, ...Otherwise you'll have to stick with quackery.", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Toni Mayer | Toni Mayer[ж]"},
    {"id": "dlg/55/2", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 55, "entry": 2, "source": "Let me see. (Buy)", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Toni Mayer | Player"},
    {"id": "dlg/55/3", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 55, "entry": 3, "source": "I can survive without (Leave)", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Toni Mayer | Player"},
    {"id": "dlg/55/4", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 55, "entry": 4, "source": "Hah! \\,\\, I have heard that so many times before,\\,\\, and yet,\\, none of them didn't!", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Toni Mayer | Toni Mayer[ж]"},
    {"id": "dlg/26/1", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 26, "entry": 1, "source": "Leave!", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Yuri Takahashi | Yuri Takahashi[ж]"},
    {"id": "dlg/26/2", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 26, "entry": 2, "source": "Security are looking for you...\\, Want to trade?", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Yuri Takahashi | Yuri Takahashi[ж]"},
    {"id": "dlg/26/3", "kind": "dialogue", "conv": 26, "entry": 3, "source": "You have stolen goods, wan't to trade?", "target": "", "status": "todo", "context": "Unused/Yuri Takahashi | Yuri Takahashi[ж]"},
